								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							&nbsp;<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/wtf1.gif" alt="WTF" border="0" /><br /><br />Flaming and being an asshole is what you&#039;re SUPPOSED to do in the Rants and Raves forum! Why the hell are you apologizing?!
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
