							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />&quot;The vast majority of our imports come from outside the country&quot;. George W.Bush<br /><br />&quot;Our enemies are innovative and resourceful, and so are we. They never stop thinking about new ways to harm our country and our people, and neither do we.&quot;—Washington, D.C., Aug. 5, 2004
